---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- 左上角的彩虹弧線 -->
  <div class="rainbow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-14 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-16 text-center">
    <p
      class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-clay-light border-2 border-ink text-ink text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-8"
      style="animation-delay: 0.05s;"
    >
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-clay" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      學生 &middot; 新竹縣兒少委員
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-display text-6xl sm:text-8xl text-ink mb-8 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
      <span class="marker px-3"><span data-text-reveal>yaya 林</span></span>
    </h1>

    <p class="reveal text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-light max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
      這裡記錄我的生活、公共參與的觀察，還有一些讓我開心的小事。
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4" style="animation-delay: 0.45s;">
      <a href="/blog" data-magnetic class="btn-pop px-7 py-3 text-sm">看看部落格 &nearr;</a>
      <a
        href="/committee"
        data-magnetic
        class="px-7 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-white text-ink text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-sage-light transition-colors"
      >
        兒少委員專區
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .rainbow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -9rem;
    left: -9rem;
    width: 22rem;
    height: 22rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at center,
      transparent 0 44%,
      var(--color-butter) 44% 58%,
      var(--color-clay-light) 58% 72%,
      var(--color-sage-light) 72% 86%,
      transparent 86%
    );
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .rainbow {
      top: -8rem;
      left: -8rem;
      width: 30rem;
      height: 30rem;
    }
  }
</style>
